WEBVTT

00:00:01.071 --> 00:00:10.271
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.081 --> 00:00:21.281
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.861 --> 00:00:30.761
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.261 --> 00:00:37.221
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.341 --> 00:00:39.271
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:43.561
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:48.441
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.851 --> 00:00:52.651
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.321 --> 00:01:00.321
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.661 --> 00:01:09.001
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.871 --> 00:01:16.001
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.211 --> 00:01:21.481
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:24.641
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:35.031 --> 00:01:36.121
Help...

00:01:36.761 --> 00:01:38.291
Save this world...

00:01:39.661 --> 00:01:42.261
O legendary Magic Knights!

00:01:50.141 --> 00:01:54.701
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:54.811 --> 00:01:58.371
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:58.481 --> 00:02:01.081
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:02:03.721 --> 00:02:05.591
Acquiring the Rune-God Selece...

00:02:05.691 --> 00:02:10.391
...they continue their journey
in search of the other two Rune-Gods.

00:02:10.501 --> 00:02:15.461
However, wherever they went,
fearsome minions sent forth...

00:02:15.571 --> 00:02:19.771
...by High Priest Zagato
awaited to challenge the girls.

00:02:20.471 --> 00:02:26.431
The Fearsome Illusionist Caldina

00:02:46.431 --> 00:02:47.591
Wait!

00:02:54.871 --> 00:02:56.931
Where the hell did they go?

00:03:09.521 --> 00:03:12.621
Caldina, are you really
going to defeat them?

00:03:13.391 --> 00:03:14.651
Of course.

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:19.221
I'm gonna defeat the Magic Knights
and let ya go back to the castle!

00:03:19.331 --> 00:03:21.771
It'll be all right so don't ya worry!

00:03:32.941 --> 00:03:34.281
There they are.

00:03:37.621 --> 00:03:39.021
This feels good!

00:03:39.381 --> 00:03:41.321
This water really is clear.

00:03:41.421 --> 00:03:42.481
I agree.

00:03:43.321 --> 00:03:44.621
Umi, Fuu...

00:03:44.721 --> 00:03:47.951
...let's take heart and go look
for the second Rune-God!

00:03:48.261 --> 00:03:49.251
Yeah!

00:03:50.361 --> 00:03:52.961
Oh? Where did Sir Mokona go?

00:03:53.161 --> 00:03:55.191
Yeah... Where?

00:03:58.501 --> 00:04:01.131
My, speak of the devil... Sir Mokona!

00:04:03.511 --> 00:04:06.571
Ms. Hikaru, something
seems to be in that direction.

00:04:06.681 --> 00:04:08.841
Maybe the second Rune-God...

00:04:11.051 --> 00:04:12.681
Mokona, guide us!

00:04:32.071 --> 00:04:33.161
Mokona!

00:04:33.271 --> 00:04:35.801
Just how far do we have to go?

00:04:51.221 --> 00:04:53.351
That's the boulder from before!

00:04:53.791 --> 00:04:55.691
When Zagato got in our way...

00:04:55.791 --> 00:04:59.561
Sir Mokona, are you telling
us to get there from here?

00:05:01.371 --> 00:05:02.531
What?

00:05:03.471 --> 00:05:06.701
How the hell do you
want us to get there?

00:05:07.111 --> 00:05:10.201
The flying ship has been broken too.

00:05:18.181 --> 00:05:22.121
Wait a sec, Mokona! Are you
saying you want us to climb that cliff?

00:05:26.491 --> 00:05:26.831
I'm gonna faint...

00:05:26.831 --> 00:05:27.561
Faint
I'm gonna faint...

00:05:27.561 --> 00:05:28.081
I'm gonna faint...

00:05:28.191 --> 00:05:31.091
We were so happy
to be able to wash our faces...

00:05:31.201 --> 00:05:34.531
...but it seems we will be
covered in dust again soon.

00:05:34.631 --> 00:05:36.031
Umi, Fuu.

00:05:36.131 --> 00:05:39.631
If we lounge around, one of
Zagato's minions might catch up.

00:05:39.741 --> 00:05:43.171
Let's go. We're gonna
revive the second Rune-God!

00:05:44.781 --> 00:05:47.111
There's no easy road in Cephiro.

00:05:59.921 --> 00:06:04.091
It seems like their goal is
that boulder floatin' in the sky.

00:06:05.261 --> 00:06:08.701
Ascot, I'll make sure I get their heads.

00:06:08.931 --> 00:06:10.921
Stay put and relax, all right?

00:06:11.041 --> 00:06:12.131
Caldina!

00:06:24.681 --> 00:06:25.941
And there.

00:06:27.991 --> 00:06:29.391
Umi! Fuu!

00:06:29.491 --> 00:06:31.081
Hurry! Hurry!

00:06:32.291 --> 00:06:35.591
Why is Hikaru always so energetic?

00:06:37.201 --> 00:06:40.861
I wish I was born a fiery girl like her!

00:06:43.101 --> 00:06:44.631
I am exhausted now.

00:06:44.741 --> 00:06:46.171
Umi! Fuu!

00:06:46.271 --> 00:06:48.261
Come over here! Over here!

00:06:48.511 --> 00:06:49.731
What's up, Hikaru?

00:06:49.841 --> 00:06:51.371
There! Look!

00:06:52.081 --> 00:06:53.041
My!

00:07:04.261 --> 00:07:09.091
I've seen this scenery before, but
Cephiro really is a beautiful place.

00:07:09.491 --> 00:07:14.121
I am sure it would be even lovelier
if Princess Emeraude were all right.

00:07:15.971 --> 00:07:19.631
I wonder what Cephiro
was like in the past...

00:07:23.171 --> 00:07:24.941
What's this scent?

00:07:26.241 --> 00:07:27.611
It smells nice!

00:07:27.711 --> 00:07:29.841
I wonder if it is a flower...

00:07:31.021 --> 00:07:32.281
My head...

00:07:32.781 --> 00:07:34.221
I feel dizzy.

00:07:35.251 --> 00:07:37.881
What's wrong all of the sudden...

00:07:42.691 --> 00:07:45.861
What is going on?
The ground suddenly...

00:07:49.601 --> 00:07:51.731
Boulders are falling on us now!

00:08:14.331 --> 00:08:15.451
Ow...

00:08:15.791 --> 00:08:19.421
I-I wonder if this is
the doing of some Mr. Monster...

00:08:25.571 --> 00:08:27.561
I-It's an illusion!

00:08:27.671 --> 00:08:28.761
Illusion?

00:08:28.871 --> 00:08:32.781
Just now, I felt as if a boulder
hit me, but it didn't hurt at all.

00:08:32.881 --> 00:08:38.141
S-Speaking of which, not one of the
falling boulders is lying in this area.

00:08:43.191 --> 00:08:45.851
If this really is just an illusion...

00:08:45.961 --> 00:08:46.261
Ms. Hikaru!

00:08:46.261 --> 00:08:47.551
Ms. Hikaru!
Hikaru!

00:08:55.801 --> 00:08:56.731
See?

00:08:58.141 --> 00:08:59.971
Is this ground also an illusion?

00:08:59.971 --> 00:09:00.511
Is this ground also an illusion?
I-I think so...

00:09:00.511 --> 00:09:02.441
I-I think so...

00:09:02.541 --> 00:09:05.571
I can't... I know, but I can't stand up!

00:09:06.441 --> 00:09:07.931
Look over there!

00:09:10.681 --> 00:09:12.311
It seems to be a cave.

00:09:12.421 --> 00:09:14.181
Let's run in there!

00:09:17.791 --> 00:09:19.951
They ran into the cave.

00:09:20.061 --> 00:09:21.651
Just what I wanted.

00:09:21.761 --> 00:09:24.691
My illusion incense sure works well!

00:09:26.601 --> 00:09:30.631
Magic Knights,
the true horror begins now.

00:09:37.841 --> 00:09:39.671
I feel sick...

00:09:40.481 --> 00:09:45.941
Walking on that spongy surface
has made me feel like I am carsick.

00:09:46.881 --> 00:09:49.441
Someone is getting in our way.

00:09:49.551 --> 00:09:52.891
So that we won't reach
the second Rune-God...

00:09:53.421 --> 00:09:55.791
Can it be one of Zagato's minions?

00:09:55.891 --> 00:09:59.491
That means we should not
be caught off guard, even now.

00:10:07.341 --> 00:10:11.471
I do not know what will be
coming out. Please be careful.

00:10:11.581 --> 00:10:14.671
Welcome, legendary Magic Knights.

00:10:15.481 --> 00:10:17.541
Can you hear me? It is me!

00:10:18.021 --> 00:10:20.011
T-That voice!

00:10:22.921 --> 00:10:24.411
Wait, Hikaru!

00:10:52.921 --> 00:10:54.581
I have been waiting.

00:10:55.521 --> 00:10:56.611
You're...

00:10:57.421 --> 00:10:59.191
Master Mage Clef...

00:10:59.521 --> 00:11:00.791
Mr. Clef...

00:11:01.361 --> 00:11:05.591
Why are you here? I thought you
were turned to stone by Zagato...

00:11:06.701 --> 00:11:09.691
I do not lose to the likes of Zagato.

00:11:09.801 --> 00:11:13.791
More importantly, Princess
Emeraude wishes to see you three.

00:11:14.171 --> 00:11:15.471
What was that?

00:11:15.571 --> 00:11:17.171
Princess Emeraude?

00:11:18.241 --> 00:11:21.911
But Princess Emeraude
is imprisoned by Zagato...

00:11:22.311 --> 00:11:24.111
I have rescued her.

00:11:24.421 --> 00:11:25.351
You did?

00:11:25.451 --> 00:11:30.581
I am not lying. As proof, Princess
Emeraude wants to meet you...

00:11:30.991 --> 00:11:34.291
...and directly
ask you to save Cephiro.

00:11:35.731 --> 00:11:38.791
Thank goodness!
The princess is all right!

00:11:40.031 --> 00:11:41.971
This seems a little strange.

00:11:42.971 --> 00:11:44.031
Strange?

00:11:44.741 --> 00:11:46.431
It is too simple.

00:11:46.541 --> 00:11:48.561
But that really was Clef.

00:11:48.671 --> 00:11:51.641
You saw him too, Fuu.
There's no mistake there.

00:12:04.921 --> 00:12:07.361
Princess Emeraude awaits within.

00:12:18.801 --> 00:12:22.671
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:12:30.081 --> 00:12:31.551
I cannot see well.

00:12:31.551 --> 00:12:32.811
I cannot see well.
Princess Emeraude!

00:12:32.921 --> 00:12:34.611
Where are you?

00:12:47.771 --> 00:12:49.361
Princess Emeraude...

00:12:52.471 --> 00:12:54.101
This is strange after all.

00:12:54.211 --> 00:12:57.231
To be able to meet
Princess Emeraude this easily...

00:12:57.341 --> 00:12:59.431
Things are going too well.

00:12:59.541 --> 00:13:02.841
Magic Knights, I am glad
you have made it here.

00:13:04.051 --> 00:13:06.881
Princess Emeraude,
may I ask you something?

00:13:08.391 --> 00:13:11.821
If Zagato has
a weakness, please tell us!

00:13:11.921 --> 00:13:12.661
Fuu!

00:13:12.661 --> 00:13:14.321
Fuu!
What's wrong, Fuu?

00:13:14.431 --> 00:13:19.261
Is there any way other than reviving
the Rune-Gods to defeat Zagato?

00:13:23.401 --> 00:13:24.991
Princess Emeraude!

00:13:30.311 --> 00:13:31.431
Look out!

00:13:34.681 --> 00:13:36.271
Princess Emeraude!

00:13:37.321 --> 00:13:39.721
I will have you die.

00:13:50.131 --> 00:13:54.261
N-No way! Why did Princess
Emeraude turn into a monster?

00:13:54.371 --> 00:13:57.531
Ms. Hikaru, Ms. Umi...
Everything was just a trap!

00:13:58.241 --> 00:13:59.231
A trap?

00:13:59.341 --> 00:14:01.241
Then that Clef earlier...

00:14:01.941 --> 00:14:04.201
Also an illusion, I assume.

00:14:06.211 --> 00:14:07.371
Damn it!

00:14:21.991 --> 00:14:23.431
Look out, Hikaru!

00:14:27.231 --> 00:14:29.361
It was just like Fuu said.

00:14:31.701 --> 00:14:34.141
Slice after slice,
there's no end to this!

00:14:44.721 --> 00:14:47.581
If this is an illusion,
why do we get hurt?

00:14:47.691 --> 00:14:49.881
These wounds may also be illusions.

00:14:49.991 --> 00:14:52.321
But this pain is real!

00:14:52.621 --> 00:14:57.821
Umi, Fuu, close your eyes. We were
fine with those boulders and trees.

00:14:57.931 --> 00:15:00.591
I'm sure we'll be fine
with these monsters too!

00:15:00.701 --> 00:15:03.461
That is right! If we close our eyes...

00:15:03.801 --> 00:15:04.891
Oh!

00:15:16.751 --> 00:15:18.721
I knew it. Nothing.

00:15:25.891 --> 00:15:27.361
Umi! Ms. Umi!

00:15:32.501 --> 00:15:33.861
Ms. Umi! Umi!

00:15:47.981 --> 00:15:50.381
My plan worked so perfectly.

00:15:50.481 --> 00:15:54.421
Nobody targeted by this
ultra-pretty, nice-bodied Caldina...

00:15:54.521 --> 00:15:56.381
...have ever survived.

00:16:05.331 --> 00:16:08.061
And now the finishing touches.

00:16:08.631 --> 00:16:10.731
The next boulder will be real.

00:16:19.711 --> 00:16:20.871
Ow...

00:16:20.981 --> 00:16:22.501
What's wrong, Mokona?

00:16:34.061 --> 00:16:34.891
What?

00:16:40.431 --> 00:16:41.521
Caldina!

00:16:41.901 --> 00:16:43.991
Caldina, are you all right?

00:16:44.901 --> 00:16:45.991
Get them...

00:16:47.271 --> 00:16:49.711
Don't fret about me.
Get the Magic Knights.

00:16:49.811 --> 00:16:50.931
But...

00:16:51.041 --> 00:16:54.601
You'll make it if you go now.
Go finish them off!

00:16:57.051 --> 00:16:58.021
Right.

00:17:01.291 --> 00:17:02.451
Come on...

00:17:02.551 --> 00:17:05.421
Hikaru, Fuu, get it together!

00:17:08.591 --> 00:17:09.521
You...

00:17:10.131 --> 00:17:12.601
How dare you hurt Caldina!

00:17:15.171 --> 00:17:16.831
Beast Summon!

00:17:22.141 --> 00:17:24.371
Sapphire Whirlwind!

00:17:30.881 --> 00:17:32.441
My friend!

00:17:32.921 --> 00:17:34.111
Damn it!

00:17:34.221 --> 00:17:35.621
Beast Summon!

00:17:38.521 --> 00:17:40.681
Water...

00:17:44.831 --> 00:17:46.421
...Dragon!

00:17:52.771 --> 00:17:55.801
No! The monsters
I couldn't finish off...

00:18:08.091 --> 00:18:10.141
Hikaru! Fuu! Wake up!

00:18:11.591 --> 00:18:13.611
Grab those girls over there!

00:18:22.231 --> 00:18:24.221
Hikaru! Fuu!

00:18:26.041 --> 00:18:29.031
How dare you kill off my dear friends.

00:18:29.571 --> 00:18:33.701
To repay you, I'll have them
play with your friends too.

00:18:34.681 --> 00:18:37.551
Stop it!

00:18:41.121 --> 00:18:42.181
You.

00:18:42.291 --> 00:18:45.521
You managed to really piss me off.

00:18:46.191 --> 00:18:48.991
To even think
of hurting Hikaru and Fuu!

00:18:49.091 --> 00:18:51.861
I-I'm not scared
of you even if you're mad!

00:18:51.961 --> 00:18:53.051
Do it!

00:19:00.341 --> 00:19:03.641
My friends...
Let go of Hikaru and Fuu!

00:19:04.041 --> 00:19:05.011
Now!

00:19:09.211 --> 00:19:11.411
Hikaru, Fuu, are you all right?

00:19:13.181 --> 00:19:15.351
We seem to be fine.

00:19:16.751 --> 00:19:20.781
Why did you attack us?
Are you one of Zagato's minions?

00:19:21.291 --> 00:19:22.191
No!

00:19:22.291 --> 00:19:23.561
Then why?

00:19:23.831 --> 00:19:27.461
Because Zagato said that
if I defeated the Magic Knights...

00:19:27.571 --> 00:19:30.661
...I could stay in
the castle with all my friends.

00:19:30.771 --> 00:19:32.031
Friends?

00:19:32.141 --> 00:19:34.631
I heard that from him before.

00:19:34.741 --> 00:19:37.761
He means the group
of beasts over there.

00:19:39.881 --> 00:19:43.371
Yeah! They're my dear friends!

00:19:43.851 --> 00:19:46.041
Those beasts from earlier too.

00:19:46.151 --> 00:19:48.121
Yet you... How dare you!

00:19:53.591 --> 00:19:55.581
If they are your dear friends...

00:19:55.691 --> 00:19:59.391
...why'd you have them attack us?
You don't care if they're killed?

00:19:59.501 --> 00:20:01.521
O-Of course I care!

00:20:01.631 --> 00:20:04.101
Then why are you helping Zagato?

00:20:04.601 --> 00:20:08.061
Because
everyone hates my friends...

00:20:08.341 --> 00:20:11.431
Everywhere we go,
we're treated like nuisances.

00:20:11.541 --> 00:20:13.911
If we could live in the castle...

00:20:14.511 --> 00:20:18.351
Do your friends cause
that much trouble to everyone?

00:20:19.021 --> 00:20:23.281
They don't! They won't
wreak havoc unless I tell them to!

00:20:24.321 --> 00:20:26.951
Then trust them.

00:20:28.391 --> 00:20:29.421
Trust?

00:20:30.061 --> 00:20:34.261
Your friends look scary
but are all good at heart, right?

00:20:34.371 --> 00:20:37.361
If you make them do
bad things as Zagato's minions...

00:20:37.471 --> 00:20:40.441
...then they really
do become bad beasts.

00:20:41.571 --> 00:20:44.171
You make them into bad beasts.

00:20:44.411 --> 00:20:46.311
Is that all right with you?

00:20:46.411 --> 00:20:47.311
No!

00:20:48.381 --> 00:20:51.971
It hasn't been
that long since we first met...

00:20:52.651 --> 00:20:54.481
...but we're good friends.

00:20:54.591 --> 00:20:57.281
We're friends that
anybody can be proud of.

00:20:59.091 --> 00:21:02.581
When I'm with
my friends, I can be stronger.

00:21:02.691 --> 00:21:04.631
I can give it more effort.

00:21:05.431 --> 00:21:10.031
You have to think of how these
creatures can be happy as well.

00:21:14.611 --> 00:21:15.941
I'm sorry.

00:21:18.511 --> 00:21:21.671
I'm sorry for attacking
your friends too.

00:21:22.381 --> 00:21:24.351
Hey, what's your name?

00:21:25.351 --> 00:21:26.541
A-Ascot.

00:21:26.981 --> 00:21:29.511
Muscat? That's a tasty name!

00:21:29.621 --> 00:21:30.711
Ascot!

00:21:31.661 --> 00:21:35.181
Ascot, do you want to be our friend?

00:21:37.961 --> 00:21:40.491
I think we can be good friends.

00:21:52.381 --> 00:21:55.781
Ascot, what's up?
Did you defeat the Magic Knights?

00:21:56.181 --> 00:21:58.611
I-It doesn't matter anymore...

00:21:59.021 --> 00:22:00.351
Not anymore...

00:22:03.091 --> 00:22:04.151
Ascot?

00:22:06.721 --> 00:22:08.851
What happened, Ascot?

00:22:26.811 --> 00:22:31.211
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:32.781 --> 00:22:38.381
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:39.821 --> 00:22:45.391
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:46.131 --> 00:22:49.961
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:52.271 --> 00:22:55.431
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:55.641 --> 00:22:58.071
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:59.181 --> 00:23:02.981
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:04.011 --> 00:23:10.651
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:11.391 --> 00:23:16.661
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:17.031 --> 00:23:23.831
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:24.331 --> 00:23:29.771
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:46.321 --> 00:23:48.451
I am Fuu Hououji.

00:23:49.191 --> 00:23:51.421
Because of Caldina's plan...

00:23:51.531 --> 00:23:55.291
...I have become separated
from Ms. Hikaru and Ms. Umi.

00:23:55.401 --> 00:23:59.961
And they both appeared in front
of my troubled self, but suddenly...

00:24:00.071 --> 00:24:04.341
...Ms. Hikaru and Ms. Umi started
attacking me with their swords!

00:24:04.681 --> 00:24:06.671
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:07.081 --> 00:24:09.411
The Most Valuable Thing in This World.

